# SparseFP4 study artifacts: keep the findings and the harness, exclude the bulk.
#
# Raw records (~215 MB gzipped JSONL), aggregate tables (~41 MB CSV) and run logs
# (~5.5 MB) stay local. They are regenerable from the harness in configs/ plus the
# commands recorded in REPORT.md and the PHASE*.md docs.
# Figures (*.png) and videos (*.mp4) are already excluded by the repo-root .gitignore.
raw/
tables/
logs/
env/
